[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Undo the nut (1a) and disconnect the electrical connections (1b,\n1c) from the starter motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428191\">A20A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052931.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Release the cover (1a) for the alternator electrical connections\nand open it.</p><p>2. Undo the nut (2a) and disconnect the electrical connection (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Alternator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428189\">A10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Keep the wiring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052932.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the wiring is not\ndamaged and test the electrical continuity.</p><p>Position the connection on the alternator\nand secure it using the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><p>Close the cover.</p><p>Position the connection on the starter\nmtor and secure it using the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><p>Test the electrical system.</p>"]]